    "title": "Live remote agent provisioning feedback and accurate VM reporting",
    "intro": "Today's nightly is centered on making remote agent cold starts feel transparent: the AgentEnvironment now streams real boot progress, accurately labels confidential VMs, and reports true VM sizing. A Windows desktop build warning was also silenced, and status probes were recalibrated to stop crying wolf on slow remote checks.",
