        "title": "Clean Windows desktop builds for the sidecar harness",
        "summary": "Silenced spurious dead-code warnings on non-Unix targets so the desktop harness builds cleanly across platforms.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Gated the managed sidecar port-detection helpers and ManagedSidecarKind variants behind cfg(any(unix, test)) so Windows builds of aura-os-desktop no longer surface dead-code warnings for Unix-only paths.",
