        "title": "Recalibrated remote agent status probes",
        "summary": "Tuned the observability probes so remote-agent checks reflect realistic cold-start latencies and dropped a noisy informational probe from the rotation.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Raised warning/outage latency thresholds for the remote-agent-create, remote-agent-state, and remote-agent-runtime probes (now in the 4–7 minute range) and bumped the default remote probe timeout to 5 minutes via a new AURA_STATUS_REMOTE_TIMEOUT_MS override, so legitimate slow boots stop firing as outages.",
